@MiniMart.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:5001

### Đăng nhập (lấy JWT access token)
POST {{MiniMart.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### Danh sách sản phẩm
GET {{MiniMart.API_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###
